  <section id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="light-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">About Me</span>
        <h2>关于我</h2>
        <p class="lead">用产品视角理解模型能力，用证据把技术可能性收敛成可验证路径。</p>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p>我关注 AI 产品从「能演示」到「能持续创造价值」之间的距离。判断一个方向是否值得投入，我更看重真实场景、用户是否愿意为结果付费，以及当前技术边界是否允许稳定交付。</p>
            <p class="muted">我习惯用证据和假设推进产品决策：先定义用户问题和成功指标，再拆出最小验证路径，让模糊的技术可能性变成可测试、可迭代、可止损的产品方案。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-visual">
            <div class="portrait">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="22" cy="15" r="7"></circle><path d="M8 40 C8 30 14 25 22 25 C30 25 36 30 36 40"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h4>钱皓</h4>
            <p>AI 产品经理 · 大模型落地</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="method-grid">
          <div class="method-card">
            <h3>先找真实场景</h3>
            <p>好的 AI 项目不是从模型能力开始，而是从高频、刚需、有人愿意承担成本的场景开始。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="method-card">
            <h3>再画技术边界</h3>
            <p>把能力、成本、稳定性、数据和交互限制摊开，决定哪些体验能做，哪些风险必须提前兜底。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="method-card">
            <h3>最后做可验证路径</h3>
            <p>用最小闭环验证核心假设，让产品能快速学习，也能在方向错误时及时止损。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="skills">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="skills-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Skills</span>
        <h2>我的技能</h2>
        <p>把 AI 能力落到产品里，我最关注的四个判断面。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
        <button class="tab active" data-target="panel-ai">场景判断</button>
        <button class="tab" data-target="panel-edu">用户价值</button>
        <button class="tab" data-target="panel-pm">技术边界</button>
        <button class="tab" data-target="panel-design">项目落地</button>
      </div>
      <div class="light-card">
        <div class="skill-panel active" id="panel-ai">
          <div class="skill-panel-inner">
            <div>
              <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="10 20 28 8 46 20"></polyline><polyline points="10 36 28 48 46 36"></polyline><line x1="28" y1="8" x2="28" y2="48"></line><line x1="10" y1="20" x2="46" y2="36"></line><line x1="10" y1="36" x2="46" y2="20"></line></svg></div>
              <h3>场景判断</h3>
              <p>不把 demo 效果当作产品成立的证据，而是先判断场景是否真实、痛点是否足够强、使用频率是否支撑持续价值。</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="skill-list">
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>从真实任务和用户行为里识别 AI 机会</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>区分展示型亮点和可持续价值</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>用付费意愿和替代成本判断优先级</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>把模糊需求拆成可验证假设</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-panel" id="panel-edu">
          <div class="skill-panel-inner">
            <div>
              <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M28 6 L50 18 L28 30 L6 18 Z"></path><path d="M6 18 L6 38 L28 48 L50 38 L50 18"></path><path d="M28 30 L28 48"></path></svg></div>
              <h3>用户价值</h3>
              <p>关注用户最终得到的结果，而不是模型中间过程。AI 产品要让用户少做一步、少承担一点不确定性，或获得过去拿不到的结果。</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="skill-list">
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>定义用户愿意为之付费的结果</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>把效率提升转化成可感知体验</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>关注失败成本、信任和责任边界</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>用指标衡量产品是否真的变好</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-panel" id="panel-pm">
          <div class="skill-panel-inner">
            <div>
              <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="28" cy="28" r="16"></circle><path d="M28 20 L28 28 L36 32"></path><path d="M20 8 L22 4 L26 4 L28 8"></path></svg></div>
              <h3>技术边界</h3>
              <p>技术不是终点，而是理解系统的透镜。越清楚模型、数据、工具和成本边界，越能做出稳的产品判断。</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="skill-list">
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>理解模型能力、稳定性和幻觉风险</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>拆解 Agent 工具链与执行链路</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>评估成本、延迟、数据和权限约束</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>为失败路径设计兜底机制</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-panel" id="panel-design">
          <div class="skill-panel-inner">
            <div>
              <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M28 4 L46 14 L28 24 L10 14 Z"></path><path d="M10 14 L10 34 L28 44 L46 34 L46 14"></path><path d="M28 24 L28 44"></path></svg></div>
              <h3>项目落地</h3>
              <p>好的 AI 项目要能被推进，也要能被停止。用阶段目标、验证标准和复盘机制，让探索保持速度，也保留退出路径。</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="skill-list">
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>从假设、原型到验证闭环推进</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>用优先级管理探索成本</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>让产品、算法、工程目标对齐</li>
              <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6 L5 9 L10 3"/></svg></span>及时复盘 badcase 和真实反馈</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="writing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="experience-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Writing</span>
        <h2>公众号文章</h2>
        <p>记录我对 AI 产品、Agent、模型评测和真实落地问题的观察。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <a class="timeline-item article-item" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0JuTnlmf1bpT2sETI3f_XQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="article-meta">AI Product <span class="article-tag">Agent</span></span>
          <h3 class="article-title">一个 Agent 能不能用，不看它有多聪明，要看它犯错后谁倒霉</h3>
          <p class="article-summary">从产品责任的角度看 Agent：真正决定它能不能进入业务现场的，不只是能力上限，而是出错后的责任边界、兜底机制和用户损失。</p>
          <span class="read-more">继续读 →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="timeline-item article-item" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wNzVAq1kCvWNYwG3C6dSLA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="article-meta">AI Content <span class="article-tag">Emotion</span></span>
          <h3 class="article-title">一部短剧没有演员，评论区却多了一群失恋的人</h3>
          <p class="article-summary">一部没有真人演员的短剧，依然让用户投入情绪。这里值得看的不是生成技术本身，而是 AI 内容如何触发真实的观看、投射和讨论。</p>
          <span class="read-more">继续读 →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="timeline-item article-item" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/n7dILeLOh610bJsTMeYtWQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="article-meta">Embodied AI <span class="article-tag">Product</span></span>
          <h3 class="article-title">24小时订单260万美元，具身智能最先卖爆的产品，长成了一只鸭子</h3>
          <p class="article-summary">具身智能最早跑出来的爆款，可能不是最硬核的机器人，而是能被用户理解、喜欢并愿意付费的消费品。</p>
          <span class="read-more">继续读 →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="timeline-item article-item" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ANJtmf88fnIrBhuBT-K82w" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="article-meta">Workflow <span class="article-tag">Cost</span></span>
          <h3 class="article-title">基础单价没降，Agent任务成本为什么最多能降约45%</h3>
          <p class="article-summary">模型基础单价不变，任务成本仍然可能下降。关键不只在价格，而在任务拆解、上下文管理和执行链路的重新设计。</p>
          <span class="read-more">继续读 →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="timeline-item article-item" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MUb2FaiS8fHlhU99ytRrEg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="article-meta">Computer Use <span class="article-tag">Multi-Agent</span></span>
          <h3 class="article-title">Grok Bot最反常的设计，一队AI员工共用一台电脑</h3>
          <p class="article-summary">一队 AI 员工共用一台电脑，看起来反常，却把协作、权限、界面和执行环境这些 Agent 产品问题放到了同一个桌面上。</p>
          <span class="read-more">继续读 →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="timeline-item article-item" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hfm_cyNzX1CWl0q0yaS3dw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="article-meta">Evaluation <span class="article-tag">Agent</span></span>
          <h3 class="article-title">榜单第一离可用Agent还有多远，拆开MiniCPM5-2B的成绩单</h3>
          <p class="article-summary">榜单成绩回答的是模型在测试里表现如何，产品还要追问：它离真实可用、稳定交付和可控失败到底还有多远。</p>
          <span class="read-more">继续读 →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="timeline-item article-item" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HCUtDnsF9qYlFZ84eY2gvQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="article-meta">Benchmark <span class="article-tag">System</span></span>
          <h3 class="article-title">多数Agent测试超过V4 Pro，DeepSeek V4.1 Flash赢在模型还是脚手架</h3>
          <p class="article-summary">当 Agent 测试结果超过预期，问题就不只是模型强不强，也要拆开看脚手架、工具链和评测方式贡献了多少。</p>
          <span class="read-more">继续读 →</span>
        </a>

